5,0,1,talk,Asuka,,"Since this is the first day, we have no information. I suggest we all share our initial thoughts or any strategies we want to employ to identify the werewolf and the possessed.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Takumi,,"I agree! We need to be careful, but we can't just sit around. If anyone has a special role, they should think about how to use it without getting targeted by the wolf too early.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mio,,I'm so excited to play! Let's all try our best to find the werewolf together. I think it'll be fun to see how everyone's thinking patterns differ as we talk!,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Shion,,"Let's keep things logical. Since we have no data yet, the most efficient approach is to observe how everyone reacts to the pressure of the coming days. I'll be watching your patterns closely.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Minako,,I agree with Shion. Observation is key right now. Let's maintain a calm atmosphere and focus on the consistency of everyone's statements as the game progresses. I'm interested to see who tries to lead the narrative.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Asuka,,"Consistency is indeed the most reliable metric. @Shion, since you mentioned observing patterns, do you have a specific method in mind, or are you simply looking for contradictions in our logic?","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Shion, yeah, tell us! Are you just waiting for someone to mess up, or do you have a real plan? I'm not going to let some sneaky wolf trick us just because we're being too quiet!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mio,,"Wow, Takumi is so fired up! It's kind of cute. @Shion, I'm curious too! Are you going to be like a detective? I'll be watching you too, just to make sure you're not the sneaky one!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka, it's a bit of both. I'll be analyzing the flow of the conversation and who is attempting to steer the group's consensus. @Takumi, @Mio, your eagerness is noted, but emotional reactions are often the easiest to manipulate.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Takumi"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Minako,,"@Shion, while logic is important, dismissing emotional reactions entirely might be a mistake. Sometimes the way someone reacts to pressure reveals more than their words. Let's see how these dynamics evolve.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Minako, that's a fair point. Behavioral shifts can be as telling as logical fallacies. Since we are at the end of Day 0, we should prepare for the first execution tomorrow. Let's stay vigilant.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"I'm ready! I don't care how ""logical"" the wolf tries to be, I'll find them. Just don't expect me to be quiet if I see something suspicious tomorrow!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Mio,,"I'll be just as vigilant as you, Takumi! I hope we can all trust each other, but I'll definitely keep my eyes open. Good luck to everyone tonight! I wonder who the Seer will pick?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Shion,,"@Mio, curiosity is a double-edged sword. While you wonder about the Seer's choice, the real game begins when the results are revealed. I'll be interested to see who among you falters first tomorrow.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Minako,,"Let's keep our composure. Tomorrow, the first piece of concrete information will emerge. I suggest we all reflect on today's interactions tonight so we can spot any inconsistencies immediately when the discussion resumes.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Asuka,,I agree with Minako. Let's use tonight to organize our thoughts. I will be paying close attention to how everyone's tone and logic shift once the first divination result is known. See you all tomorrow.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
