24,0,4,talk,Mio,,I'll be dreaming of a way to help the village! Let's all have a good night's sleep so we're sharp for tomorrow. See you all then!,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
