26,0,4,talk,Shion,,"I've seen enough for today. The initial dynamics are clear, and the roles will start to bleed through once the first night's result is processed. I'll be waiting for the cracks to appear.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Shion,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
